      937       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      938            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D
      939            size 98.88 by 15.79
      940            TITLE "".
      941   ASSIGN
      942          FRAME v-suppl:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      943          FRAME v-suppl:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
