     1168   END.
     1169   ELSE DO:
     1170     run prn-lib-open-stream  in this-procedure (
     1171                                                 input parParentProc
     1172                                                 ,input 43
     1173                                                 ,input yes
     1174                                                 ,input no
     1175                                                 ).
     1176        FORM with FRAME gds-brutto-shop.
     1177   END.
     1178   FORM HEADER
     1179       Line format "X(229)" AT 1 SKIP
     1180       "Продолжение - на следующей странице" AT 60 SKIP
     1181       with FRAME BottomFrame width 232
     1182       PAGE-BOTTOM no-labels no-box.
     1183   VIEW STREAM PrnLibStream FRAME BottomFrame .
     1184   PUT STREAM PrnLibStream
     1185       string( "Отчет за период с: " + string(from-date,"99/99/9999") + " по: " + string(to-date,"99/99/9999"))
     1186       AT 37 format "X(229)" SKIP(1).
     1187       ASSIGN num-order = 0.
     1188   FOR EACH prt-parts-brutto:
     1189         ASSIGN num-order = num-order + 1.
     1190         if parkindrep = "OUT" THEN DO:
     1191            DISPLAY STREAM PrnLibStream
     1192            sym1
     1193            num-order
     1194            sym2
     1195            prt-parts-brutto.in-date
     1196            sym3
     1197            prt-parts-brutto.cst-code
     1198            sym4
     1199            prt-parts-brutto.tnved
     1200            sym5
     1201            prt-parts-brutto.gds-name
     1202            sym6
